# React + Next.js Component Patterns

## Component structure
```typescript
'use client';  // Chỉ khi cần (event handlers, useState, useEffect)

import { useState } from 'react';
import type { User } from '@/lib/types';

interface Props {
  user: User;
  onSelect?: (id: string) => void;
}

export function ProfileCard({ user, onSelect }: Props) {
  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);

  return (
    <div className="rounded-lg border p-4">
      {/* ... */}
    </div>
  );
}
```

## Server vs Client Components

**Default = Server Component** (no `'use client'`):
- Static UI, data fetching from DB
- SEO-friendly content
- No event handlers, no useState/useEffect

**Add `'use client'` ONLY when:**
- Có event handlers (onClick, onChange)
- Dùng useState, useEffect, useRef
- Dùng browser APIs (localStorage, window)
- Dùng third-party libs that need client (Framer Motion, etc.)

## Data Fetching Patterns

### Server Component (default)
```typescript
// app/users/page.tsx
import { createClient } from '@/lib/supabase/server';

export default async function UsersPage() {
  const supabase = createClient();
  const { data: users } = await supabase
    .from('users')
    .select('*')
    .order('created_at', { ascending: false });

  return <UserList users={users ?? []} />;
}
```

### Client Component with hook
```typescript
// hooks/use-users.ts
import { useEffect, useState } from 'react';
import { createClient } from '@/lib/supabase/client';
import type { User } from '@/lib/types';

export function useUsers() {
  const [users, setUsers] = useState<User[]>([]);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);

  useEffect(() => {
    const supabase = createClient();
    supabase.from('users').select('*').then(({ data }) => {
      setUsers(data ?? []);
      setLoading(false);
    });
  }, []);

  return { users, loading };
}
```

## Required States (UX)

Every data-fetching component PHẢI handle:
- **Loading state** — skeleton hoặc spinner
- **Empty state** — "Chưa có dữ liệu" message
- **Error state** — error boundary hoặc inline message

```typescript
{loading && <Skeleton />}
{!loading && users.length === 0 && <EmptyState />}
{!loading && users.length > 0 && <UserList users={users} />}
```

## Form Patterns

### Server Action (preferred)
```typescript
// app/users/actions.ts
'use server';

import { z } from 'zod';
import { createClient } from '@/lib/supabase/server';
import { revalidatePath } from 'next/cache';

const userSchema = z.object({
  name: z.string().min(1),
  email: z.string().email(),
});

export async function createUser(formData: FormData) {
  const validated = userSchema.parse({
    name: formData.get('name'),
    email: formData.get('email'),
  });

  const supabase = createClient();
  const { error } = await supabase.from('users').insert(validated);

  if (error) {
    return { error: 'Có lỗi xảy ra, vui lòng thử lại' };
  }

  revalidatePath('/users');
  return { success: true };
}
```

## Performance Tips

- `React.memo` chỉ khi thực sự cần (đo bằng React DevTools Profiler)
- `useMemo`/`useCallback` chỉ cho expensive computations
- Avoid inline object/array trong JSX (`<X config={{}} />`) — gây re-render
- Dynamic import cho heavy components: `dynamic(() => import('./heavy'))`

## Accessibility

- Mọi `<button>` cần có `type="button"` (hoặc `"submit"` cho form)
- Mọi `<input>` cần có `<label>` associated
- Mọi `<img>` cần có `alt` (hoặc `alt=""` nếu decorative)
- Focus states rõ ràng (Tailwind: `focus-visible:ring-2`)
- Keyboard navigation hoạt động được

## Common Mistakes to Avoid

❌ Default export components → use named export
❌ `any` types → use proper types or `unknown` + narrowing
❌ Inline async in JSX (`{await fetch()}`) → use Server Component or hook
❌ `useEffect` cho data fetching → prefer Server Component or SWR/Tanstack Query
❌ State inside parent → drilling props 5 levels → use Context or Zustand
